{"about_the_game":"(DISCLAIMER! This game was built using a template! It was more of a learning project that i was happy with how it turned out. Hence the cheap price.)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>features:</strong></h2></h2><br>Your dropped into a map, given 2 guns to start with, which you must use to fight almost endless waves of the dead. <strong>Can you Survive?</strong><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NEW MODE! <strong>Bots Team deathmatch! </strong>You and your AI Team VS Another AI Team!</h2></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879000/extras/3ba0c201520cd9ebea1e8ca91d06c167.poster.avif?t=1757026735\" width=720 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879000/extras/3ba0c201520cd9ebea1e8ca91d06c167.webm?t=1757026735\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879000/extras/3ba0c201520cd9ebea1e8ca91d06c167.mp4?t=1757026735\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NEW Zombies Map! (Eastern Village)</h2></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879000/extras/3f297f2f6dc35b37b7af16422e6d7f14.avif?t=1757026735\" width=800 height=256 /></span><br><br>As you get higher in waves, you will notice zombies getting <strong>stronger</strong>, and the weapons you started with no longer have much affect against the dead, so its time to look for the <strong>mystery crate</strong>. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879000/extras/78245ad458b395ec7b590d01d316e44c.poster.avif?t=1757026735\" width=720 height=240 ><source src=\"https:/